{
  "_about": "Every master in this repository: one file per companion and pose. kind is core or extension for poses in AnkiQuest-Server tests/fixtures/companion_poses.json, picture for other per-companion art (moment, notification and icon pictures). origin is shigeyuki for a file of Shigeyuki's Anki-tan asset pack v1.0, unchanged (pack is its path in the pack), derivative for art AnkiQuest made from his Anki-tan, ankiquest for AnkiQuest's own companions; author is who to credit. shared lists pictures of more than one companion. missing lists the core poses a companion has no master for yet, tracked in AnkiQuest-Server#57; extensions without a master show their fallback and are not listed. archive lists what archive/ holds, which is never exported: retired pictures one by one, with the master that replaced them, and the rest of Shigeyuki's pack by folder.",
